{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":45,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华给巴录的许诺"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["犹大王约西亚的儿子约雅敬第四年，尼利亚的儿子巴录将先知耶利米口中所说的话写在书上。耶利米说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「巴录啊，耶和华—以色列的 神说："]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["巴录",{"noteId":45},"曾说：『哀哉！耶和华将忧愁加在我的痛苦上，我因唉哼而困乏，不得安歇。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你要这样告诉他，耶和华如此说：我所建立的，我必拆毁；我所栽植的，我必拔出；在全地我都如此行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你为自己图谋大事吗？不要图谋！我必使灾祸临到凡有血气的。但你无论往哪里去，我必使你以自己的命为掠物。这是耶和华说的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":45,"caller":"-","text":"原文是你","reference":{"chapter":45,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/45.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/46.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/44.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}